611
01:00:25,760 --> 01:00:28,120
Guia-me mansamente a águas tranquilas.

612
01:00:28,200 --> 01:00:30,040
Refrigera a minha alma.

613
01:00:30,920 --> 01:00:33,320
Guia-me nas veredas da justiça

614
01:00:33,400 --> 01:00:35,120
